WEBVTT

NOTE
Galbadia Garden sequence — approach to the plaza.
Duration: approximately 28 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A bright flash fills the screen.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The flash comes from a jetpack as a person in a futuristic suit with engines flies by

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
They are flying in formation, with one green in front and six yellow behind in two-by-two formation

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The float turns, its gold and teal mechanics gliding

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
An aerial view of Galbadia Garden, a mobile academy with a crimson core, encircled by glowing golden rings and anchored by a vertical beam, its structure wrapped in geometric walkways and greenery

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The slow landing on the entrance’s pale walkway, flanked by stone pillars topped with fierce gargoyle statues
